    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. that \"quiet page\" sounds almost peaceful, i guess. but it's hard to stay in the middle of it all when everything feels so finished. like, if the story is actually over, what is the point of staying for the credits? it feels like i'm just lingering when there's nothing left to see.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
